i":39990.0,"e":"14935/2023","a":"C","u":"SBn%2FlMgTwMNSYrkJkLlFdw%3D%3D","c":null},{"f":"2023-09-28","i":39953.83,"e":"14311/2023","a":"B","u":"u8PPOAaxwniOUi78BmzhOQ%3D%3D","c":null},{"f":"2023-05-15","i":39984.82,"e":"2769/2023","a":"A","u":"wBmupsCVt%2BHjHF5qKI4aaw%3D%3D","c":null}],"q":null,"nivel":"insuficiente"}},"entidad":{"id":"EP4624600E","nombre":"Ayuntamiento de Torrent"},"hash":"e932fc8bca23efb9","ia":{"es":"Qué muestran los datos: Entre 2023 y 2025, este organismo adjudicó 42 contratos menores de servicios y suministros de más de 14.000 y hasta 15.000 euros, justo por debajo del límite legal. Si esos importes se repartieran como en la franja inmediatamente inferior, lo esperable serían 5,6 contratos. La razón entre observados y esperados es 7,5, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 4,5 a 12,6. El contrato [1], de 14.875,90 euros, se adjudicó en marzo de 2024.\nQué no pueden demostrar: la acumulación de importes junto al límite es un indicador estadístico. No prueba que se haya partido ningún contrato ni que alguien haya actuado mal; puede deberse a precios de mercado, a presupuestos cerrados o a necesidades distintas.\nQué se puede revisar: en los expedientes enlazados, qué se contrató en cada caso y en qué fechas, y si varios contratos atienden una misma necesidad que pudo contratarse de una vez.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 42 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 5.6 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 7.5, with a 95% confidence interval of 4.5 to 12.6. December accounts for 17% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 15% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 38 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,875.90 euros, was awarded in March 2024.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Small amounts near the limit can reflect market prices or budget constraints. The distribution across many different suppliers does not prove any single supplier was favored.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of contracts [1] and [2] to see if they align with the December trend. Review the awardees in [3] to confirm if multiple contracts were for similar needs. Look for repeated purchases from the same supplier to assess if multiple contracts were for the same service.","origen_es":"plantilla","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["xfPL7FOxNlmsNfRW6APEDw%3D%3D","OZ9i%2Fzg18oh9PLkba5eRog%3D%3D","M0lJftNM3Ewl5NjlNci%2BtA%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}